    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Hero is a train railway action puzzle game with a retro feel. It\u2019s easy to play but hard to master and you only need one click to play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conduct trains, switch tracks and use your brain to avoid collisions and to make sure all trains arrive in time at their stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress in increasingly challenging levels, you unlock access to powerups and new beautiful worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many regions to explore, with different skins and more than 120 levels to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is available in English, French, German, Greek, Italian and Spanish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level editor is included and you can use it to edit existing levels or create your own.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train Hero is a train railway action puzzle game with a retro feel. It\u2019s easy to play but hard to master and you only need one click to play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conduct trains, switch tracks and use your brain to avoid collisions and to make sure all trains arrive in time at their stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress in increasingly challenging levels, you unlock access to powerups and new beautiful worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many regions to explore, with different skins and more than 120 levels to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is available in English, French, German, Greek, Italian and Spanish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A level editor is included and you can use it to edit existing levels or create your own.</p>",
